(text "Supply: J2 or J3 (one source). D10 protects polarity.\nVIN_HEAT feeds all four heater connectors through R30.\nOne INA226 measures total heater current, excluding the logic LDO.\nCurrent rating is limited by connectors, diode, shunt and PCB thermals." (at 25.4000 238.7600 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4455c493-967b-5def-a66a-a8785fcc020e"))
(text "CHANNELS\n0: J101 / Q102 / PA0\n1: J201 / Q202 / PA1\n2: J301 / Q302 / PA2\n3: J401 / Q402 / PA3" (at 307.3400 231.1400 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "dc5b7b0a-80d3-558b-87a5-04534fe9c62e"))
